<div class="container">
    <div class="content-box hero">
        <h1>👑 The Circles Dynasty 👑</h1>
        <p>Behold the Royal Lineage of Circles - Ancient Sovereigns of Perfect Geometry</p>
        <div class="circle-display">
            <div class="circle" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; background: var(--circle-gold);">👑</div>
            <div class="circle" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; background: var(--circle-silver);">💎</div>
            <div class="circle" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; background: var(--circle-bronze);">⚜️</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-box">
        <h2>The Royal Proclamation</h2>
        <p style="font-style: italic; font-size: 1.2rem; text-align: center; padding: 1rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd89b 0%, #19547b 100%); border-radius: 10px; color: white;">
            "In the beginning, before squares knew corners and triangles had angles, there existed the Circles Dynasty - 
            perfect beings of infinite symmetry, whose rule extends beyond dimensions and whose wisdom encompasses all radii."
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-box">
        <h2>The Ruling Monarchs</h2>
        
        <div class="dynasty-member">
            <h3>🌟 King Circumfero the Infinite</h3>
            <p class="title">Supreme Sovereign of All Circles, First of His Name, Keeper of Pi</p>
            <p class="reign">Reign: Since the Dawn of Geometry (∞ BCE - Present)</p>
            <p>King Circumfero the Infinite is the eternal ruler of the Circles Dynasty. Born at the precise moment when mathematics itself came into existence, he embodies the very essence of circular perfection. His crown is forged from pure Pi, and he possesses the power to calculate circumference with but a thought. Legend says that his radius extends to infinity, yet he maintains perfect form.</p>
            <p><strong>Royal Powers:</strong> Infinite rotation, perfect symmetry, and the ability to inscribe any polygon within his divine form.</p>
            <p><strong>Royal Decree:</strong> "Let all angles bow before the curvature eternal!"</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dynasty-member">
            <h3>💫 Queen Arealia the Encompassing</h3>
            <p class="title">Consort to King Circumfero, Guardian of Interior Space, Lady of πr²</p>
            <p class="reign">Reign: Co-ruler since 3141 BCE</p>
            <p>Queen Arealia governs all that lies within the circular boundary. She is known for her generous nature, always maximizing the space she provides for her subjects. Her wisdom teaches that "among all shapes of equal perimeter, the circle encompasses the greatest area." She wears a gown woven from infinite points, all equidistant from her heart.</p>
            <p><strong>Royal Powers:</strong> Maximization of interior space, perfect distribution of resources, and the gift of complete coverage.</p>
            <p><strong>Royal Motto:</strong> "Within my bounds, all are equally embraced."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dynasty-member">
            <h3>⚜️ Prince Diametrius the Straight</h3>
            <p class="title">Heir Apparent, Crown Prince of Bisection, Duke of Straight Passages</p>
            <p class="reign">Born: Year 6283 of the Circular Calendar</p>
            <p>The rebellious heir to the throne, Prince Diametrius is unique among the royal family for his fascination with straight lines. He is the only line permitted to pass through the sacred center, earning him both respect and suspicion. His straight path cuts through political circles, dividing issues with mathematical precision. Despite his linear nature, he maintains his circular heritage, being exactly twice the length of his father's radius.</p>
            <p><strong>Royal Powers:</strong> Bisection, perfect passage through the center, and the rare ability to be both circular and linear.</p>
            <p><strong>Personal Creed:</strong> "I am my father's double, yet I walk a straight path."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="dynasty-member">
            <h3>✨ Princess Tangentia the Ethereal</h3>
            <p class="title">The Untouchable One, Guardian of Boundaries, Duchess of Single Points</p>
            <p class="reign">Born: Year 9000 of the Circular Calendar</p>
            <p>Princess Tangentia is known throughout the realm for her elusive nature. She touches the circle at only one perfect point, never crossing the boundary, forever dancing at the edge of her family's domain. Poets write sonnets about her graceful approach, and mathematicians study her perpendicular relationship to her uncle, Radius. She represents the delicate balance between connection and independence.</p>
            <p><strong>Royal Powers:</strong> Perfect perpendicularity, single-point contact, and the ability to extend to infinity while maintaining her connection.</p>
            <p><strong>Famous Quote:</strong> "I kiss the circle but once, yet our connection is eternal."</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-box">
        <h2>The Royal Court</h2>
        
        <div class="info-grid">
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>📐 Duke Radius the True</h3>
                <p><strong>Title:</strong> Lord of Measurements, Keeper of Distance</p>
                <p>The most trusted advisor to the throne, Duke Radius connects the center to all subjects equally. His fairness and consistency make him invaluable to the realm.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>🎭 Countess Chordia of the Bow</h3>
                <p><strong>Title:</strong> Lady of Connections, Mistress of Strings</p>
                <p>She connects any two points on the royal boundary, creating harmony and communication throughout the kingdom. Her influence is strongest when she passes through the center.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>🌙 Baron Arc the Partial</h3>
                <p><strong>Title:</strong> Master of Segments, Guardian of Portions</p>
                <p>Baron Arc rules over the portions of the great circumference. He teaches that every part, no matter how small, contains the essence of the whole.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>⭐ Marquess Sector the Divisor</h3>
                <p><strong>Title:</strong> Lord of Pie Slices, Distributor of Angles</p>
                <p>Responsible for dividing the kingdom fairly, Marquess Sector ensures that each portion maintains its connection to the royal center through twin radii.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-box">
        <h2>The Sacred Council of Concentric Circles</h2>
        <p>Below the royal family sits the Sacred Council - circles within circles, each maintaining perfect parallelism with the throne:</p>
        
        <div class="dynasty-member" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #89f7fe 0%, #66a6ff 100%);">
            <h3>The Inner Circle</h3>
            <p>The most trusted advisors, closest to the center of power. They include the ancient circles of Small Radius, whose wisdom comes from intimacy with the origin point.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="dynasty-member" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8edea 0%, #fed6e3 100%);">
            <h3>The Middle Circle</h3>
            <p>Administrative circles who maintain order throughout the realm. They balance proximity to power with accessibility to the outer territories.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="dynasty-member" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fecfef 100%);">
            <h3>The Outer Circle</h3>
            <p>Guardians of the boundary, protectors of the realm. They define where the Circle Dynasty ends and the outer chaos begins.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

