        <ul style="line-height: 2.5; font-size: 1.1rem;">
            <li>📜 <strong>Year 0:</strong> The Great Centering - King Circumfero establishes the eternal center point</li>
            <li>⚔️ <strong>Year 314:</strong> The War of the Polygons - Circles defend their smoothness against the Square Uprising</li>
            <li>💒 <strong>Year 1592:</strong> The Royal Wedding - Circumfero weds Arealia in a ceremony attended by all geometric shapes</li>
            <li>📐 <strong>Year 2718:</strong> The Discovery of e - A distant cousin joins the royal mathematical family</li>
            <li>🎓 <strong>Year 6283:</strong> Birth of Prince Diametrius - The first straight line born to circular parents</li>
            <li>🌟 <strong>Year 7850:</strong> The Great Integration - Circles become fundamental to calculus</li>
            <li>✨ <strong>Year 9000:</strong> Birth of Princess Tangentia - The untouchable one arrives</li>
            <li>🎭 <strong>Year 12000:</strong> The Harmony Accord - Circles declare peace with all conic sections</li>
        </ul>
