    <div class="content-box">
        <h2>Current State of the Realm</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            The Circles Dynasty continues to thrive in the modern age. While other shapes have risen and fallen - 
            triangles have warred amongst themselves, rectangles have built rigid empires - the circles remain eternal. 
            King Circumfero maintains diplomatic relations with all geometric forms, hosting the annual Geometry Gala 
